Two carve-outs
--------------

1. TRADEMARK. The HoopsLab name, the HoopsLab mark and the wordmark are
   trademark-adjacent. The licence above covers copying the files; it
   does not grant permission to present a fork, product or service as
   being HoopsLab, endorsed by HoopsLab, or affiliated with it. Use the
   marks to refer to HoopsLab; do not use them to label something that
   is not.

2. TYPEFACES. The fonts in fonts/ (Anton, Barlow) are not ours. They are
   licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 by their respective
   authors — see fonts/OFL-Anton.txt and fonts/OFL-Barlow.txt, which
   travel with the files and govern their use.

The source code in other HoopsLab repositories is MIT licensed; that is
a separate grant and is stated in each repository.
